<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Mi Landing</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="css/styles.css">
</head>

<body>
    <%- include('partials/header.ejs') %>

        <!-- first part hero  -->
        <section class="hero">
            <div class="heroText">
                <h1>Speak real Spanish and
                    feel at home in Latin
                    America</h1>
                <p>Dynamic, natural conversation
                    classes for professionals and retirees
                    ready for true local integration.</p>
                <button><a href="#programs" class="btn">Book your Diagnostic Session</a></button>
            </div>

            <div class="heroImage">
                <img src="/images/hero.jpg" alt="Video">
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- second part problems -->
        <section id="problems" class="problems">
            <div class="problesTitle">
                <h2>Does this sound like
                    you?</h2>
            </div>

            <div class="problemsText">
                <p>Know some words, but fear is holding you
                    back from speaking?</p>
                <p>Stuck in a "tourist bubble" and struggling
                    to build a local network?</p>
                <p>Tired of dry grammar drills that don't
                    help in real life?</p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <div class="cta">
            <p>You don't need perfect grammar to speak with
                confidence. With the Frazeando method, you'll
                turn isolated words into fluent conversations
                through structured practice and ultra-small groups
                —starting your very first week.</p>
            <button>Book your Diagnostic Session</button>
        </div>

        <!-- third part Why learn with me?  -->
        <section class="infoSection">
            <div class="cta">
                <h2>Why Learn With Me:</h2>
                <p>Language isn't meant to be locked in a textbook. While
                    grammar has its place, real-life Spanish is dynamic and
                    fluid. I teach you the language people actually speak on the
                    streets of Latin America—in a supportive, judgment-free
                    space where making mistakes is just part of the learning
                    process. Connect, don't just conjugate.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="cta">
                <h2>The Story Behind Frazeando:</h2>
                <div class="infoDetail">
                    <p>First paragraph.</p>
                    <p>Second paragraph.</p>
                </div>
                <button>Button text</button>
            </div>
        </section>


        <script type="module" src="/js/script.js"></script>
</body>

</html>